    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You maintain a small set of imbuement catalyst scraps to create cantrip imbuements. A cantrip imbuement is a special type of imbuement that doesn't use imbuement slot. You can create a cantrip imbuement at will, any number of times per day. A cantrip is automatically heightened to half your level rounded up—this is usually equal to the highest level of imbuement catalyst you have.</p>"
    },
